{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52162","headline":"五言七夕侍宴赋得归衣飞机一首应诏 · 许敬宗","name":"五言七夕侍宴赋得归衣飞机一首应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一年衔别怨，七夕始言归。\n破涕开新靥，微步登云梯。\n天回兔渐没，河旷鹊停飞。\n那堪尽今夜，复往弄残机。\n（同前）（按：《全唐诗》卷三五据《唐诗纪事》录《七夕赋咏成篇》，爲七律，中有四句与本诗相近，今人或疑七律爲後人僞作，实无的据。\n七律见收於宋绶《岁时杂咏》〖见《古今岁时杂咏》卷二五〗。\n诗句重用，古人多有。\n今另作一首收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}